{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Behold, I send an angel before you.</b> As long as you do My will, I walk before you in the pillar of cloud; but when you turn away from following Me, I send none other than an angel. Another interpretation: <b>Behold, I send an angel</b> — a prophet and emissary. And it is said of Joshua. And one cannot say an actual angel, for HaShem did not say to send an angel until they made the calf, and even so, they did not accept him."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:04.536264511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}